**/.DS_Store
# Ryft.xcodeproj is committed: it's the source of truth (CLAUDE.md) and CI builds it.
# Per-user state inside it stays out (xcuserdata below).
# Anchored to the root: only the build output here is ignored. Unanchored, the rule would also match any folder of
# that name deeper in the tree, in any letter case on a Mac (paths ignore case there).
/build/
DerivedData/
xcuserdata/
*.xcuserstate
# Satoshi is free to embed but may not be redistributed via repositories (ITF FFL §02).
# Fetch locally with scripts/fetch-fonts.sh.
Ryft/Resources/Fonts/*.otf
Ryft/Resources/Fonts/*.ttf
.build/
docs/screenshots/*-tmp.png
# Local overrides; copy Config/*.xcconfig.example. Production.xcconfig is committed.
Config/*.xcconfig
!Config/Production.xcconfig
__pycache__/
# Real training exports for local import tests: personal data, never committed (fixtures are synthetic).
local-samples/
